valid:border-destructive transition-[color,box-shadow] overflow-hidden text-foreground [a&amp;]:hover:bg-accent [a&amp;]:hover:text-accent-foreground rounded-full font-normal\" href=\"/tag/mdx\">MDX</a><a data-slot=\"badge\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs w-fit whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3 gap-1 [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive transition-[color,box-shadow] overflow-hidden text-foreground [a&amp;]:hover:bg-accent [a&amp;]:hover:text-accent-foreground rounded-full font-normal\" href=\"/tag/typescript\">TypeScript</a></div></div><h1 class=\"text-lg leading-normal font-bold tracking-tight md:text-2xl md:leading-tight md:font-normal\">A Beginner’s Guide to Using Markdown and MDX with Next.js</h1><div class=\"py-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\" href=\"https://x.com/cakegaly\"><img alt=\"cakegaly\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"bg-muted rounded-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Favatars%2Fcakegaly.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Favatars%2Fcakegaly.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Favatars%2Fcakegaly.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"flex-1 text-left leading-tight\"><p class=\"font-medium\">cakegaly</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs\">@<!-- -->cakegaly</p></div></a></div></header><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"my-6 rounded-lg border p-4 shadow-sm border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/50 dark:border-blue-900 dark:bg-blue-950/30\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-1 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info size-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"w-full min-w-0\"><div class=\"mb-1 font-medium text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300\">Info</div><div class=\"text-foreground/90 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">The text below is from the <a class=\"font-medium underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/mdx\">Vercel</a>\ndocs. I copied it here to test the markdown styles. <strong class=\"font-medium\">Vercel is awesome. You\nshould use it.</strong></p></div></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\"><a class=\"font-medium underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"https://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/syntax\">Markdown</a> is a lightweight markup language used to format text. It allows you to write using plain text syntax and convert it to structurally valid HTML. It&#x27;s commonly used for writing content on websites and blogs.</p>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">You write...</p>\n<figure class=\"\" data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre class=\"no-scrollbar min-w-0 overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3.5 outline-none has-[[data-highlighted-line]]:px-0 has-[[data-line-numbers]]:px-0 has-[[data-slot=tabs]]:p-0\" style=\"--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"md\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\"><button data-slot=\"copy-button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:hover:bg-accent/50 bg-code absolute top-3 right-2 z-10 size-7 hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Copy</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button><code data-language=\"md\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\" style=\"display:grid\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">I </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold;--shiki-light:#1F2328;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold\">**love**</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> using [</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-light:#0A3069;--shiki-light-text-decoration:inherit\">Next.js</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">](</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-light:#1F2328;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline\">https://nextjs.org/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">)</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">Output:</p>\n<figure class=\"\" data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre class=\"no-scrollbar min-w-0 overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3.5 outline-none has-[[data-highlighted-line]]:px-0 has-[[data-line-numbers]]:px-0 has-[[data-slot=tabs]]:p-0\" style=\"--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"html\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\"><button data-slot=\"copy-button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:hover:bg-accent/50 bg-code absolute top-3 right-2 z-10 size-7 hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Copy</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button><code data-language=\"html\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\" style=\"display:grid\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-light:#116329\">p</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&gt;I &lt;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-light:#116329\">strong</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&gt;love&lt;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-light:#116329\">strong</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&gt; using &lt;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-light:#116329\">a</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#B392F0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> href</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">&quot;https://nextjs.org/&quot;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&gt;Next.js&lt;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-light:#116329\">a</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&gt;&lt;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-light:#116329\">p</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\"><a class=\"font-medium underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"https://mdxjs.com/\">MDX</a> is a superset of markdown that lets you write <a class=\"font-medium underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"https://react.dev/learn/writing-markup-with-jsx\">JSX</a> directly in your markdown files. It is a powerful way to add dynamic interactivity and embed React components within your content.</p>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">Next.js can support both local MDX content inside your application, as well as remote MDX files fetched dynamically on the server. The Next.js plugin handles transforming markdown and React components into HTML, including support for usage in Server Components (the default in App Router).</p>\n<blockquote class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 pl-6 italic\">\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\"><strong class=\"font-medium\">Good to know</strong>: View the <a class=\"font-medium underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"https://vercel.com/templates/next.js/portfolio-starter-kit\">Portfolio Starter Kit</a> template for a complete working example.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"my-4 md:my-8\"/>\n<h2 id=\"install-dependencies\" class=\"font-heading mt-12 scroll-m-28 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight first:mt-0 lg:mt-20 [&amp;+p]:!mt-4\">Install dependencies</h2>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">The <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">@next/mdx</code> package, and related packages, are used to configure Next.js so it can process markdown and MDX. <strong class=\"font-medium\">It sources data from local files</strong>, allowing you to create pages with a <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">.md</code> or <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">.mdx</code> extension, directly in your <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">/pages</code> or <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">/app</code> directory.</p>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">Install these packages to render MDX with Next.js:</p>\n<figure class=\"\" data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption class=\"text-code-foreground [&amp;_svg]:text-code-foreground flex items-center gap-2 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:opacity-70\" data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path></svg>Terminal</figcaption><pre class=\"no-scrollbar min-w-0 overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3.5 outline-none has-[[data-highlighted-line]]:px-0 has-[[data-line-numbers]]:px-0 has-[[data-slot=tabs]]:p-0\" style=\"--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\"><button data-slot=\"copy-button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:hover:bg-accent/50 bg-code absolute top-3 right-2 z-10 size-7 hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Copy</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\" style=\"display:grid\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#B392F0;--shiki-light:#953800\">npm</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> @next/mdx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> @mdx-js/loader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> @mdx-js/react</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> @types/mdx</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<hr class=\"my-4 md:my-8\"/>\n<h2 id=\"configure-,[object-object]\" class=\"font-heading mt-12 scroll-m-28 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight first:mt-0 lg:mt-20 [&amp;+p]:!mt-4\">Configure <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">next.config.mjs</code></h2>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">Update the <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">next.config.mjs</code> file at your project&#x27;s root to configure it to use MDX:</p>\n<figure class=\"\" data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption class=\"text-code-foreground [&amp;_svg]:text-code-foreground flex items-center gap-2 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:opacity-70\" data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"js\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\"><svg role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fill-foreground\"><title>JavaScript</title><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0V0zm22.034 18.276c-.175-1.095-.888-2.015-3.003-2.873-.736-.345-1.554-.585-1.797-1.14-.091-.33-.105-.51-.046-.705.15-.646.915-.84 1.515-.66.39.12.75.42.976.9 1.034-.676 1.034-.676 1.755-1.125-.27-.42-.404-.601-.586-.78-.63-.705-1.469-1.065-2.834-1.034l-.705.089c-.676.165-1.32.525-1.71 1.005-1.14 1.291-.811 3.541.569 4.471 1.365 1.02 3.361 1.244 3.616 2.205.24 1.17-.87 1.545-1.966 1.41-.811-.18-1.26-.586-1.755-1.336l-1.83 1.051c.21.48.45.689.81 1.109 1.74 1.756 6.09 1.666 6.871-1.004.029-.09.24-.705.074-1.65l.046.067zm-8.983-7.245h-2.248c0 1.938-.009 3.864-.009 5.805 0 1.232.063 2.363-.138 2.711-.33.689-1.18.601-1.566.48-.396-.196-.597-.466-.83-.855-.063-.105-.11-.196-.127-.196l-1.825 1.125c.305.63.75 1.172 1.324 1.517.855.51 2.004.675 3.207.405.783-.226 1.458-.691 1.811-1.411.51-.93.402-2.07.397-3.346.012-2.054 0-4.109 0-6.179l.004-.056z\"></path></svg>next.config.mjs</figcaption><pre class=\"no-scrollbar min-w-0 overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3.5 outline-none has-[[data-highlighted-line]]:px-0 has-[[data-line-numbers]]:px-0 has-[[data-slot=tabs]]:p-0\" style=\"--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-li