span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> Welcome </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F97583;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> &#x27;@/markdown/welcome.mdx&#x27;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F97583;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F97583;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> default</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F97583;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> function</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#B392F0;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> Page</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#953800\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#F97583;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> &lt;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-light:#116329\">Welcome</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> /&gt;;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">Navigating to the <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">/mdx-page</code> route should display your rendered MDX page.</p>\n<h3 class=\"font-heading mt-8 scroll-m-28 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Using dynamic imports</h3>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">You can import dynamic MDX components instead of using filesystem routing for MDX files.</p>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">For example, you can have a dynamic route segment which loads MDX components from a separate directory:</p>\n<img alt=\"Image\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1598\" height=\"1236\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mt-6 rounded-md border\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fundraw%2Fimage-01.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fundraw%2Fimage-01.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fundraw%2Fimage-01.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\"><a class=\"font-medium underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"/docs/app/api-reference/functions/generate-static-params\"><code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">generateStaticParams</code></a> can be used to prerender the provided routes. By marking <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">dynamicParams</code> as <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">false</code>, accessing a route not defined in <code class=\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\">generateStaticParams</code> will 404.</p>\n<figure class=\"\" data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption class=\"text-code-foreground [&amp;_svg]:text-code-foreground flex items-center gap-2 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:opacity-70\" data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"github-dark github-light-default\"><svg role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"fill-foreground\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M1.125 0C.502 0 0 .502 0 1.125v21.75C0 23.498.502 24 1.125 24h21.75c.623 0 1.125-.502 1.125-1.125V1.125C24 .502 23.498 0 22.875 0zm17.363 9.75c.612 0 1.154.037 1.627.111a6.38 6.38 0 0 1 1.306.34v2.458a3.95 3.95 0 0 0-.643-.361 5.093 5.093 0 0 0-.717-.26 5.453 5.453 0 0 0-1.426-.2c-.3 0-.573.028-.819.086a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-.623.242c-.17.104-.3.229-.393.374a.888.888 0 0 0-.14.49c0 .196.053.373.156.529.104.156.252.304.443.444s.423.276.696.41c.273.135.582.274.926.416.47.197.892.407 1.266.628.